SCOPE

This license covers the TOOLS and DOCUMENTATION in this repository, and the
English translation text in analysis/english_script.json and
analysis/glossary.json.

It does NOT and cannot cover Super Robot Taisen Z itself. The game, its script,
its data and its assets remain the property of Banpresto / Bandai Namco. This
repository contains none of them, and you need your own copy of the game for
any of it to be useful.

The translation is a derivative work of the game made by fans, distributed in
the hope that it is useful, with no claim on the underlying work.
